    "title": "Quickstart",
    "html": "<h1>Quickstart</h1>\n<h2>1. Install</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">npm i -g golmet-cli\n</code></pre>\n<h2>2. Initialize a workspace</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">golmet init my-product\n</code></pre>\n<p>The wizard asks for your agent, your repositories and creates the workspace layout.</p>\n<h2>3. Open your agent in the folder</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">opencode\n</code></pre>\n<p>Or the engine you picked during install — the MCP server of the kit is already configured.</p>\n<h2>4. Talk</h2>\n<p>Describe the product. The workflow produces charter → requirements (RNs) → specs → tasks — all markdown, all versioned in your git.</p>\n<h2>5. Keep it true</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">golmet validate\n</code></pre>\n<p>The guardian blocks anything that drifted.</p>\n",
